ing eligible for leadership elections [[GH-398](https://github.com/hashicorp/raft/pull/398)]\n93\t* Remove an unneeded `io.Copy` from snapshot writes [[GH-399](https://github.com/hashicorp/raft/pull/399)]\n94\t* Log decoded candidate address in `duplicate requestVote` warning [[GH-400](https://github.com/hashicorp/raft/pull/400)]\n95\t* Prevent starting a TCP transport when IP address is `nil` [[GH-403](https://github.com/hashicorp/raft/pull/403)]\n96\t* Reject leadership transfer requests when in candidate state to prevent indefinite blocking while unable to elect a leader [[GH-413](https://github.com/hashicorp/raft/pull/413)]\n97\t* Add labels for metric metadata to reduce cardinality of metric names [[GH-409](https://github.com/hashicorp/raft/pull/409)]\n98\t* Add peers metric [[GH-413](https://github.com/hashicorp/raft/pull/431)]\n99\t    16\t\n100\tBUG FIXES\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
